            "review_title": "Review at Roast & Smoke Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "junebiswas\nBangkok, Thailand409 contributions\n0\nGreat food great vibe\nAug 2023 • Couples\nThis is a beautiful pet friendly bbq cafe is the place for all meat lovers, where you can try the finest smoked meats, slow-cooked to juicy tenderness. There are lots of dishes to choose from and we couldn't get enough of their brisket, which is barbecued to perfection for 12 hours and melts right in your fork. We ordered the brisket and pork ribs platter which was absolutely heavenly. We also tried their spaghetti carbonara. The owner and chef are really sweet and friendly and it is evident that the place is a hot favorite among expats and pet lovers! Definitely one of my favorite places to eat in HCM.\nRead more\nWritten August 2, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
