            "review_title": "Review at Roast & Smoke Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Greg R\nIquitos, Peru647 contributions\n1\nThese people clearly take some pride in their offering.\nApr 2022\nThis is a nice quiet nook in suburban Ho Chi Minh City. The garden is lovely and welcoming. The menu is perfectly expansive. The food is served with a definite pride and attention to care. The cafe is a bit out of the way but worth the trouble.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 22, 2022\nTrung Lee\nDear Greg,\n\nThank you so much for your kind words, we are really glad that you are having a good time at Roast & Smoke.\n\nOur goal is to create a hideout place where people can come and feel relaxed, just to get away from the bustling & hustling urban city.\n\nWe are hoping to have you again at R&S Greg!\nRead more\nWritten April 23, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
